Lavaṇa mocks Śatrughna and hurls giant tree --- Śatrughna shatters tree and answers with taunts --- Lavaṇa hurls many trees and fells Śatrughna senseless --- Gods wail as Lavaṇa leaves Śatrughna for dead --- Śatrughna revives and takes Viṣṇu's infallible arrow --- Brahmā tells gods the arrow killed Madhu and Kaiṭabha --- Śatrughna pierces Lavaṇa's chest to Rasātala --- Lavaṇa falls and Śiva's trident returns to Rudra